    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "programmeDescription": "Psychology at Erasmus University Rotterdam studies behaviour, emotion, development and cognition through psychological theory, research methods and practical training. The pathway shown continues through Brain & Cognition after the shared core.",
    "comparisonExplanation": "UCR offers a broad psychology programme and two related options focusing on cognition and mind, or psychology and organisations. They share substantial psychological inquiry with Erasmus, while adding other disciplines. Dedicated psychometrics, specialist professional training and the compulsory 14-EC thesis are not reproduced.",
